{"id": "unknown-2026-09-21-021", "date": "2026-09-21", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 39, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Fraunhofer IPMS researchers develop a highly efficient WRGB OLED microdisplay on a 28 nm CMOS process", "content": "<p>Researchers from the <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/fraunhofer-institute-photonic-microsystems\">Fraunhofer IPMS</a> have developed a new WRGB (WOLED) OLED microdisplay, based on a 28 nm CMOS process. The researchers say that this new display is highly efficient and features the smallest pixels to date.&nbsp;</p><div class=\"align-center\">\n  \n  <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/2026-09/Fraunhofer-IPMS-WRGB-720x540-28nm-OLED-microdisplay-2026.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">\n    \n ", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/fraunhofer-ipms-researchers-develop-highly-efficient-wrgb-oled-microdisplay-28", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "lg_display-2026-09-21-022", "date": "2026-09-21", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 39, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": ["lg_display", "lg_elec"], "customers": ["lg_elec"], "suppliers": ["lg_display"]}, "topics": ["panel_price", "oled_penetration", "it_panel_demand"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.9, "reasons": ["多公司提及", "供應鏈上下游同時提及"]}, "title": "LG Display launches a 24.5\" 720Hz OLED monitor panel, specifically targeting eports gaming", "content": "<p>LG Display announced that it is starting to mass produce 24.5\" FHD (1920x1080) 720Hz gaming monitor OLED panels. The company says that this is the first-ever OLED panel tailored specifically for esports.&nbsp;</p><div>\n  \n  <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/2026-09/LGD-24-5-inch-720Hz-esports-gaming-monitor-panel.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">\n    \n    <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/styles/large/public/2026-09/LGD-24-5-inch-720Hz-esports-gam", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/lg-display-launches-245-720hz-oled-monitor-panel-specifically-targeting-eports", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-09-21-023", "date": "2026-09-21", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 39, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "UDC's UVJC to unveil its first commercial vapor jet deposition system next month", "content": "<p>In &nbsp;2025, Universal Display Corporation (UDC) established a new Singapore-based subsidiary, <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/universal-vapor-jet-corporation\">Universal Vapor Jet Corporation</a> (UVJC) to handle its OVJP technology development, after it closed down its California OVJP center. Later UDC <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/udcs-ovjp-subsidiary-invest-39-million-over-next-5-years-rd-across-wide-range\">announced</a> that UVJC has opened its new headquarters and R&amp;D cente", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/udcs-uvjc-unveil-its-first-commercial-vapor-jet-deposition-system-next-month", "type": "rss"}]}
